DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: The intention is to use periods of livelihood disruption not only to provide temporary income,

asr-001315
01:02:22.500 --> 01:02:27.860
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: but also to build alternative and complementary economic opportunities for coastal households.

asr-001316
01:02:28.000 --> 01:02:30.860
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: Trabahong Dagat has three specialized tracks.

asr-001317
01:02:31.340 --> 01:02:35.920
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: Dagat Skills and Services for Track 1 focuses on competencies such as

asr-001318
01:02:35.920 --> 01:02:41.880
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: seamanship, maritime safety, boat and engine maintenance, net repair, and shore-based maritime support.

asr-001319
01:02:42.500 --> 01:02:47.480
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: ISDA Skills and Production for Track 2 covers aquaculture, sustainable practices,

asr-001320
01:02:47.940 --> 01:02:52.460
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: fishing processing, food safety, hatchery operations, and post-harvest activities.

asr-001321
01:02:52.460 --> 01:02:57.260
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: Track 3, or Blue Enterprise Development, supports qualified beneficiaries

asr-001322
01:02:57.260 --> 01:02:57.980
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: who are ready to start their business.

asr-001323
01:02:57.980 --> 01:03:04.000
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: To organize into fisheries-related micro-enterprises with starter support and operational coaching.

asr-001324
01:03:04.600 --> 01:03:07.480
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: Beneficiaries are not placed into one uniform intervention.

asr-001325
01:03:08.160 --> 01:03:12.900
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: The pathway depends on local community opportunities, skills, and economic potential.

asr-001326
01:03:13.620 --> 01:03:16.360
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: Implementation begins with area and fisheries profiling.

asr-001327
01:03:16.880 --> 01:03:22.220
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: DOLE coordinates with DA, BFAR, TESDA, and LGUs to understand local fisheries,

asr-001328
01:03:22.400 --> 01:03:26.520
DOLE Planning Service Director Patrick P. Patriwirawan Jr.: seasonal work patterns, skills needs, facilities, and available employment.

asr-001330
01:03:27.320 --> 01:03:28.860
